& [DevelopmentPolicy] is specification-first reversible vertical slicing
  + preserve user dictation separately before interpretation
  + explode the holistic intuition into one falsifiable identity-preserving field cycle
  + specify feature flow and typed states before implementation
  + preserve failed profiles as evidence and version every prompt schema or compiler meaning change
  + require positive control hostile-boundary and replay evidence before disposition

& [Implementation] is one safe-Rust model-host attention cycle
  + strict SemanticField elements boundaries probes candidates delineation latch exchanges events and report records reject unknown fields
  + four deterministic full-membership presentation orders vary base reverse rotation and even-odd interleave
  + exact sorted member sets require three-of-four support with deterministic tie-breaking
  + typed provider wire selects finite IDs assessment order and relation kinds
  + deterministic compilation forms FieldProbe records exact identity self-bindings and an adjacent connected relation chain
  + ordinary host validation enforces identities content digests hard boundaries graph coverage connectivity contradiction exclusion and uncertainty
  + LATCH is a pure terminal gate whose only positive status is admitted_for_attention under the field purpose

& [ProviderBoundary] uses ordinary unmodified llama.cpp
  + provider interaction is loopback-only OpenAI-compatible /v1 HTTP
  + hidden reasoning keys are recursively excluded from persistent evidence
  + model responses remain provisional data and do not acquire host authority
  + output files use create-new publication and are never overwritten
  + model discovery precedes report construction and therefore remains outside typed replay when it fails

& [Replay] is historical and semantic rather than digest-only
  + request profiles 0.1 through 0.5 reconstruct their exact historical prompts schemas and compiler behavior
  + each stored probe recomputes from its exact request and provider response
  + candidate delineation result latch state order and report digest recompute
  + response-backed probe delineation and control faults recompute their exact error text
  + redigesting a changed request or response cannot make the changed semantic lineage valid
  + event states ordinals and evidence references must match one exact fixture live control aggregation or fault trajectory
  + additive assurance distinguishes deterministic construction stored provider replay response-backed fault replay and structural runtime fault only
  + structural runtime fault validity preserves a declaration without claiming its unretained external cause was reconstructed
  + effect-free closure audit reconciles preserved sources proof references acceptance deployment and final verifier identities and rederives cost identity plus statistics from all thirty-one provider reports

& [Control] is structurally non-latchable
  + exactly one control_probe_1 exchange may produce one FieldProbe
  + terminal state is control_completed
  + candidate delineation latch and fault records remain absent

& [LiveCampaign] is isolated EVO-X2 mechanism evidence
  + [v1] free-text filler reaches uncertainty and is rejected
  + [v2] prompt-hardened free text still yields filler self edge and rejection
  + [v3] missing array bound yields a replay-valid public-output exhaustion fault
  + [v4] strict conflict attribution yields a replay-valid compiler fault
  + [v5] four-of-four exact-set support separate supported typed delineation and all host gates produce admitted_for_attention
  + [control] one identical ordinary selection produces no candidate or latch
  + [hostile] four-of-four selection crossing forbid_co_membership is rejected before candidate promotion
  + [noninterference] llama PID 12780 and creation value remain unchanged and no persistent process is added

& [Deployment] retains all predecessors plus one final verifier
  + [final_binary_sha256] is abf9c33976320297018bc90723c50ee779b746b129539daaf963e91f5eb40b52 over 2840064 bytes
  + [remote_path] is C:\AI\services\cantor-field-cycle\cantor-field-cycle-p0-h8.exe
  + [deployment_manifest] is C:\Project\Cantor\experiments\cantor_field_cycle_p0\deployment_manifest_2026-08-18.json
  + final remote replay verifies seven historical thirteen repeatability nine hardening smoke and two relation-boundary reports across profiles 0.1 through 0.5
  + h5 replays all thirty-one provider reports under exact event-reference trajectories without provider inference or llama process change
  + h6 replays the same corpus as twenty-nine stored-provider and two response-backed-fault assurances without provider inference or llama process change
  + h7 advertises the closed four-value assurance vocabulary and reproduces the same corpus distribution remotely
  + h8 adds same-handle ceiling-plus-one local file reads and reproduces the same corpus distribution remotely
  + a successor read-only audit hashes h8 before and after replay and requires all thirty-one remote reports to equal their tracked local bytes
  + the audit exposes inherited Authenticated Users Modify and Synchronize as an open deployment trust-root residual

& [IdentityHardening] closes report-level provenance gaps
  + run identity and provider model must be nonempty
  + every report class must declare one supported historical request profile
  + non-fixture provider identity must be canonical loopback HTTP without userinfo path query fragment invalid port or remote host
  + five positive five control and three hostile reruns preserve the intended structural dispositions
  + stable output does not repair the retained conflict-versus-support semantic warning

& [ResourceHardening] closes the signed bounded-payload requirement
  + UTF-8 host text field and report files provider time and provider response bytes have inspectable numeric ceilings
  + local input opens once checks same-handle metadata and streams at most the declared ceiling plus one sentinel byte before deserialization
  + output over any ceiling faults without truncation retry or silent repair
  + non-success response bodies are represented by status size and digest rather than copied content
  + reports self-verify before create-new publication
  + proxy use and redirect following are disabled so admitted loopback routing cannot escape after URL validation
  + the sequential CLI uses Tokio current-thread runtime rather than a multithread scheduler

& [CostCharacterization] is corpus-bound
  + thirty-one provider reports are grouped as completed control faulted host-boundary rejection and post-delineation rejection
  + completed typed cycles use 2751 through 2761 total tokens while one-pass controls use exactly 496
  + host-boundary rejection omits delineation and uses exactly 2245 tokens
  + free-text predecessors use more tokens and more than twice the mean provider-reported compute of typed completions
  + the ordered raw-report digest makes every aggregate recomputable
  - never: generalize these measurements beyond the recorded model field server cache and process conditions

& [Boundary] is experimental attention I/O only
  + completed structure proves mechanism and contract satisfaction not semantic correctness
  + correlated probes are not independent witnesses
  + unattributed whole-proposal conflict followed by supported delineation remains an open semantic-quality residual
  + exact deployment bytes under a modifiable inherited ACL are observation evidence rather than a protected production trust root
  + provider preflight failures and non-exact CLI option admission remain explicit successor requirements
  - never: infer truth safety authorization production trust hidden attention holistic cognition database authority effects or dynamic procedure authority
